        (σ/(6*J))*(U:ℝ)-3/2 ≤ (Agrid.card:ℝ) ∧ (Agrid.card:ℝ) ≤ (14*σ/c)*(U:ℝ)+1/2 ∧
        (∀ Q : ℕ, 2 ≤ Q →
