    1 ≤ β → Δ < 1/2 →
    (∀ i, rp i ≠ 0) →
    (∀ i, xref i∈Ioo (1/2:ℝ) (W i-1/2)) →
    (∀ i, iteratedDeriv 2 (f i) (xref i)/2=(ep i:ℝ)/rp i) →
