      0 < η → η ≤ 1/8 → 0 < T → 0 < M → 0 < R →
      (∀ i∈S, y i∈Icc (1:ℝ) 2) →
      (∀ i∈S, (L i:ℝ)-2*(N:ℝ)∈Icc M (2*M)) →
