    Mat 0*Mat 3-Mat 1*Mat 2=1 →
    (∀ j∈S, (Mat 2:ℝ)*(rat j 0:ℝ)+Mat 3=(q j 1:ℝ)/q j 0) →
    (∀ j∈S, ((Mat 0:ℝ)*(rat j 0:ℝ)+Mat 1)/
      ((Mat 2:ℝ)*(rat j 0:ℝ)+Mat 3)=(rat j 1:ℝ)) →
